# The Debian base system apt runs in (see rootfs/usr/lib/jk_os/apt): the
# "slim" root filesystem the official Docker image is made of, built by
# debuerreotype (github.com/debuerreotype/docker-debian-artifacts), fetched by
# scripts/update-debian-rootfs.sh into userspace/debian/<arch>/rootfs.tar.gz.
#
# <arch>  <suite>  <artifacts commit (branch dist-<debian arch>)>  <sha256>
# The sha256 is the image layer's digest from the commit's OCI manifest.
